			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 715010101,
					"content": "嗯…这两天情况在越发恶化，勘探队的行动也会受限。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010102,
					"content": "有谁能解决这样的委托呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010103,
						715010104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010103,
					"content": "怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010105,
					"content": "#啊，是{NICKNAME}和派蒙，真是来得正好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010106,
					"content": "来得正好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010107,
					"content": "听上去又有发生了什么麻烦事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010108,
					"content": "这段时间，不知道为什么，层岩巨渊的矿洞和矿道突然涌出了大量的黑色泥状物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010109,
					"content": "因为是突发情况，勘探队也没法立刻做出应对，调查进度也一停再停，海迪夫也向冒险家协会委托寻找协助者…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010110,
					"content": "啊？黑色泥状物，难道是层岩巨渊下面那种…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010111,
					"content": "对，就是那类黑泥，不知道为什么涌到了矿洞和矿道那边，勘探队调查进程受阻不说，就连日常的行动都要受到影响…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010112,
					"content": "毕竟大量资源和材料都得倚靠矿道进行运输。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010113,
					"content": "这样多久了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010114,
					"content": "有一段时间了，虽然海迪夫说他找到了愿意帮忙的须弥学者，但是那名学者也需要协助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010115,
					"content": "我正为有谁能解决这件事而头疼呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010116,
					"content": "海迪夫的委托，酬劳应该很多吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010117,
					"content": "没有人愿意去吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010118,
					"content": "毕竟那些黑色的泥状物还是很危险的…没有人愿意接这份委托啊。虽然因为酬金来的人很多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010119,
					"content": "但许多冒险家一听到是在层岩巨渊，就打起了退堂鼓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010120,
					"content": "而且，大部分冒险家对于层岩巨渊下的环境也并不熟悉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010121,
					"content": "能够接受这项委托的，应该是既不害怕危险，又对层岩巨渊环境十分了解的人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010122,
					"content": "我正烦恼如何找到可以担当此任的人，你们就路过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010123,
					"content": "#原来是这样，{NICKNAME}，看上去情况真的很危急呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010124,
						715010125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010124,
					"content": "嗯，得去看看才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010126,
					"content": "那我们现在就去层岩巨渊找海迪夫吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010127,
					"content": "啊，关于这点…海迪夫说你直接去找那位须弥学者就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010128,
					"content": "他的原句是这样说的：「如果有愿意来的人，就让他去层岩巨渊的营地前吧，那家伙一直在那边调整设备呢。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010129,
					"content": "好，我们马上就去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010130,
					"content": "嗯，层岩巨渊的安全，就交给你们了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凯瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010125,
					"content": "就当帮海迪夫一次吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010104,
					"content": "发生什么事了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010105
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7150102,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7150102
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
